# Xilonen Furina Xianyun Chiori. ~20s Rot. Xilonen cancels plunge endlag with NAs as dashes spend nightsoul. Only 6/8 Geo plunges with C0, 8/8 with C1. Xilonen and Chiori alternate skill and burst and to fill time. 50% collisions.

